   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Don't talk to me, rookie!",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "They're all dead. Guy must've had some kind of explosive on him, set off all the ordinance in this place at once.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Congratulations, rookie. You just cost me my job. Don't think I don't appreciate it.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I was just telling Gloria about your performance. Hell of a first day, huh?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Welcome to the Silver Rush, New Vegas's best- ah, I'm just kidding. Go on in.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Welcome to the Silv- ah crap, don't tell me you're my new guard.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Okay, now let's get you geared up. First, your armor.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Standard issue is your run-of-the-mill combat armor, with a nice dark coat of paint for both brand recognition and sheer intimidation value.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Next, your weapon. Guards are required to use rifles. Anything lighter compromises your combat effectiveness.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Anything heavier and people are too scared to come in the door. What's your preference, laser or plasma?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Welcome to the Silver Rush, New Vegas's best source of laser and plasma weapons.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Don't hurry me. I'm trying to get your stuff ready.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
