   ],
   "topic": "VMS29aVFSVanGraffThug09Topic002",
   "prompt": "Looks like we're stuck with each other."
  },
  {
   "key": "vms29avfsvangraffthug09topic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Good choice. I prefer laser-based weapons myself, but the boss lady said she wants at least one guard using a plasma rifle.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Says the lightning bits draw in more people. Whatever.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Now that you're equipped, a quick word on the job at hand. In a nutshell, we're here to keep the riff-raff away.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Drunks, punks, and capless vermin are to be turned away. Potential customers are to be permitted normal entrance.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "That is, after we pat them down for weapons. An unarmed man is a lot less likely to try to steal something with several armed guards around.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Don't start any fights. I don't care if some Jet junkie just insulted your mother, we're here to promote violence elsewhere, not start it here.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Lastly, don't abandon your post. We're getting paid to stand next to this door, not talk to someone down the street or head to the casino.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "That goes double for any thoughts of splitting with that gear. Every now and then some young punk thinks he can run off with Van Graff property.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Trust me, the rifle and armor are nice, but they're not worth your life.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Other than that, relax. There's usually some eye candy coming and going from the Wrangler over there at some point, so the view's not too bad.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Other than that, relax. Who knows, you might attract a high roller from the Wrangler over there and never have to pull a gig like this again!",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VMS29aVFSVanGraffThug09Topic003",
   "prompt": "Laser."
  },
  {
   "key": "vms29avfsvangraffthug09topic004",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Nothing wrong with going plasma. Just make sure you hit what you're aiming at.",
